{"title":"Monday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/919007198/0/marginalrevolution~Monday-assorted-links.html","date":1748276208000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://lydialaurenson.substack.com/p/why-i-was-part-of-the-neoreactionary?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1735163&amp;post_id=164364595&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Lydia Laurenson</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://jpandrew.substack.com/p/my-interview-with-galen-strawson-edd?r=7wya1&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;triedRedirect=true\" target=\"_blank\">More from Galen Strawson</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. “But the lawsuit claimed the NYT’s original story had “portrayed the Marubo people as a community unable to handle basic exposure to the internet, highlighting allegations that their youth had become consumed by pornography”.”  Link <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cx2ekvnrkpno\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.  This likely means the tribe is overall happy to have the internet connection, right?</p>\r\n<p>4. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.politico.com/news/magazine/2025/05/23/doug-wilson-new-right-pastor-hegseth-trump-officials-00355376\" target=\"_blank\">His primary message for those people, he told me, is that “theocracy” isn’t a scary concept.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>5. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.cbc.ca/news/health/canada-measles-elimination-risk-1.7541504\" target=\"_blank\">Canada has more measles cases right now than any other country in the Americas.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>6. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ctvnews.ca/politics/article/andrew-scheer-supports-united-canada-wont-condemn-alberta-separation-referendum/\" target=\"_blank\">The Conservative Leader in the House of Commons says he “can absolutely advocate for a united Canada,” but won’t specifically condemn a possible referendum on Alberta separation.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/linusekenstam/status/1926668575634325864?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">A veo 3 video</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/monday-assorted-links-510.html\">Monday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/919007198/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/919007198/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/919007198/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/919007198/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/919007198/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/919007198/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/monday-assorted-links-510.html#respond\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/monday-assorted-links-510.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.